<mj-section background-color="#eff1f4" padding="1px 1px 1px 1px" border-radius="10px">
  <mj-column background-color="#fff" border-radius="10px" padding="0px">
    <mj-image
      border-radius="10px 10px 0 0"
      padding="0"
      width="600px"
      src="https://www.londonsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
      alt="Greener streets fund"
      href="https://www.londonsummary.com/"
    />
    <mj-text
      padding="20px 20px 0px 20px"
      font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
      color="#000000"
    >
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
        Greener streets fund
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-text padding="0px 20px 0px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding-top: 15px; margin: 0;">
  <strong>What’s happening?</strong> Transport for London will <a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/info-for/media/press-releases/2026/march/tfl-invests-94-8m-with-london-boroughs-to-deliver-safer-greener-streets-in-2026-27" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">allocate £94.8M to London boroughs</a> in 2026/27 to improve safer, greener streets. The funding will support borough-led projects such as new cycle routes, pedestrian crossings, School Streets, and measures to reduce road danger. It will also help improve bus reliability, expand micromobility and cycle parking, and introduce lower speed limits.
</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; padding-top: 15px; margin: 0;">
  <strong>Vision Zero strategy:</strong> Vision Zero is London’s long-term road safety strategy aimed at eliminating all deaths and serious injuries from the transport network by 2041. The strategy focuses on redesigning streets and transport systems so that human mistakes do not result in fatal or severe crashes. Key measures include lower speed limits, safer road layouts, protected cycle lanes, improved pedestrian crossings, and stricter enforcement against dangerous driving.
</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; padding-top: 15px; padding-bottom: 20px; margin: 0;">
  <strong>Big picture: </strong>The programme also supports climate and air-quality goals by promoting sustainable travel and cutting congestion. Working closely with borough councils ensures projects are tailored to local needs. In the long term, the funding is part of a wider strategy to reshape urban mobility, support economic activity, and make London’s streets healthier, more accessible and environmentally sustainable.
</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
<mj-spacer height="20px" />
    
<mj-section background-color="#eff1f4" padding="1px 1px 1px 1px" border-radius="10px">
