    <mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Art &amp; culture</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://londonist.com/london/art-and-photography/a-place-beyond-statue-thomas-j-price-v-a" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">A towering public sculpture by Thomas J Price has been unveiled outside V&amp;A East Museum ahead of the museum’s opening in April</a>. Titled A Place Beyond, the 18-foot bronze statue depicts a casually dressed young person holding a phone, reflecting Price’s signature “everyperson” style. The sculpture aims to make the museum space feel welcoming and representative of everyday people.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://www.msn.com/en-gb/travel/news/david-hockney-new-paintings-by-bradford-born-artist-to-go-on-display-in-london/ar-AA1Yscev?ocid=BingNewsSerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">An exhibition by David Hockney has opened at Serpentine North Gallery in London</a>, showcasing a series of recent artworks by the 88-year-old painter. Titled David Hockney: A Year in Normandie And Some Other Thoughts About Painting, the exhibition features still life paintings and portraits of people from Hockney’s inner circle, including family members and carers. The show will run from March 12 to August 23.
  </td>
</tr>
</mj-table>
<mj-text padding="20px 20px 10px 20px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <h3 style="font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;">Sports</h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-table
  font-family="Arial"
  cellpadding="0"
  cellspacing="0"
  padding="0px 32px 0px 32px"
  style="width: 100%"
>
  <tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
  "> &#8226; </td>
  <td style="
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-left: 0px;
  ">
    <a href="https://sports.yahoo.com/articles/sports-centre-revamp-reaches-key-055554944.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Plans have been submitted to redevelop the Crystal Palace National Sports Centre</a>. The proposal includes a major refurbishment of the 1964-built, Grade II-listed complex, upgrading its athletics stadium, indoor arena, and swimming and diving facilities. The redevelopment would add sports amenities such as padel courts, 3x3 basketball courts, five-a-side football pitches, and a multi-sports field.
  </td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="
    font-size: 18px;
    vertical-align: top;
    line-height: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 8px;
