        <mj-text
          align="center"
          padding="10px 30px 20px 30px"
          font-family="Arial"
          color="#000000"
        >
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; margin: 0 !important">
    London's oldest building is the <a href="https://www.visitlondon.com/things-to-do/place/45615751-london-mithraeum" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #80011F; color: black;">Temple of Mithras</a> constructed around AD 240. Unearthed in 1954, it has been reconstructed at its original site within Bloomberg's European headquarters near the Bank of England.
  </p>
